  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "自分だけのファンタジージョブを創り出すことが出来る『30 MINUTES FANTASY』より、「30MF アイテムショップ2(ファイターオプション)」が登場！",
      "en": "\"30MF Item Shop 2 (Fighter Option)\" is now available from \" 30 MINUTES FANTASY\" where you can create your own fantasy job!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• “アーマークロス”［装甲換装］の幅を広げる武装やアイテムが詰まったセット。",
      "en": "• A set packed with weapons and items that expand the range of “Armor Cloth” [Armor Replacement]."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 肩、胸アーマーのパーツに加え、2種類のフェイスパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• In addition to shoulder and chest armor parts, two types of face parts are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「ランス」と「ツインソード」が付属。ツインソードはジョイントパーツで接続可能。",
      "en": "• \"Lance \" and \" Twin Sword\" are included. Twin swords can be connected with joint parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「木箱」と「木製ジョッキ」が付属。「木箱」は蓋を開閉可能。",
      "en": "• \"Wooden box \" and \" wooden mug \" are included. The \" wooden box\" has a lid that can be opened and closed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "（※付属品の木箱、木製ジョッキは設定上の名称となります）",
      "en": "(*The attached wooden box and wooden mug are the names used in the settings.)"
    }
  ],
